{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Heads up before anything else:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crabs and Rats</i> is still <strong>in active development</strong>, so there\u2019s plenty more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear <strong>what you expect from the game</strong> and <strong>what you\u2019d like to see added</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re reading all your feedback\u2014bring it on! \ud83e\udd80\ud83d\udc00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721790/extras/fe5b60527cca1bfaeb17a666f57fa1ef.poster.avif?t=1766603425\" width=544 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721790/extras/fe5b60527cca1bfaeb17a666f57fa1ef.webm?t=1766603425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721790/extras/fe5b60527cca1bfaeb17a666f57fa1ef.mp4?t=1766603425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Contextualize in Aghrrr&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>148X</i> - On a stormy night at sea, Boris, a half-hearted pirate, lies drowsy in his bunk, plagued by a sharp stomachache. As he writhes in discomfort, he tumbles across the floor of his cabin, tormented by hallucinations brought on by malnutrition, vitamin deficiency, and the relentless rocking of the ship. In his delirium, Boris faces a terrifying vision. Now, he must fight for his life and find a way to escape this nightmare\u2026 or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabs and Rats</strong> is a 2D platformer with a <strong>Pixel Art and Cartoon</strong> style, set in a chaotic pirate world. Inspired by the <strong>vertical slider</strong> format, the game challenges players to <strong>dodge obstacles, avoid deadly traps, and escape from white rats and massive green crabs</strong>, all while trying not to fall into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>two-player local co-op</strong>, the game puts your reflexes and coordination to the test as you navigate through collapsing wooden platforms, fast-paced levels, and unpredictable hazards.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kawazaki ONE PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/a4a7871233dee7722941a34c1c009e3db97864cb.jpg"},{"name":"Kawazaki Logrado TWO PLAYERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/ddb68863c374b309608b70c51beda7328c550a7e.jpg"},{"name":"Mr Crabs Jr ONE PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/a2990ac5620d024329c9ab6eaa3e1ed0b160addc.jpg"},{"name":"Mr Crabs Jr TWO PLAYERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/428bb85fa1369c96d5c2ecb3dbafdddd200dd87e.jpg"},{"name":"Clawpocalypse Now TWO PLAYERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/b5dc2da932678c2e938a8a0d5e7ec32eb8b7c11a.jpg"},{"name":"Clawpocalypse Now ONE PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/a6b5c083e35ef02fbbfea7556fa6a0ca399ab1c8.jpg"},{"name":"Fantkrabft TWO PLAYERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/8c26500a65b5d95a80ada8aab3b057372a1ef95b.jpg"},{"name":"Fantkrabft ONE PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/28509239dbadcbde9d53187010778da884871ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Cruga Buga TWO PLAYERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721790/cd799f2924d0100e6fcb8d691f25a160e6046463.jpg"},{"name":"Cruga Buga ONE PLAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun